# KEYS silent while recording: a project saved with the track muted in the part, its takes 1-6 muted (REC + white
# used to mute layers) or the piano soloed - REC on the track makes it heard again (live, and the take played back)
wait 300
onnote 1
tap SAVE
wait 100
tapkey w4
wait 300
tap HOME
wait 100
turn SELECT -1
wait 100
expect track 1
setpmask 0 2
setlmute 1 126
setsolo 0 1
key w0 down 100
wait 200
expect tlevel2 0
key w0 up
wait 300
tap REC
wait 300
expect pmask 0
expect solo0 0
key w0 down 100
wait 200
expect tvoices2 >0
expect tlevel2 >2
key w0 up
key w2 down 100
wait 300
key w2 up
wait 6000
tap REC
wait 300
expect eventsA2 >1
expect lmute 124
wait 300
expect tvoices2 >0
wait 800
expect tlevel2 >2
